171
00:12:38,060 --> 00:12:39,310
‪Let's get back to smoking.

172
00:12:39,930 --> 00:12:40,970
‪Tayama.

173
00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:44,610
‪I think it was right about you
‪having a dual personality.

174
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:50,360
