‪You saw me from somewhere again?

246
00:18:23,190 --> 00:18:27,150
‪A large, middle-aged man loitering by
‪the entrance sticks out like a sore thumb.

247
00:18:28,110 --> 00:18:29,780
‪Sorry to be a bother.

248
00:18:31,370 --> 00:18:32,870
‪So? Why no purchase?

249
00:18:37,620 --> 00:18:41,000
‪It was hot yesterday, 
‪so I wanted an ice cream.

250
00:18:41,540 --> 00:18:42,540
‪Okay?

251
00:18:43,340 --> 00:18:47,680
‪But the store was full of negative ions, 
‪which cooled me down quick.

252
00:18:48,430 --> 00:18:49,430
‪Negative ions?

253
00:18:51,890 --> 00:18:52,980
‪Well, well.

254
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:57,310
‪And here I was thinking it was Yamada's
‪short sleeves that blew the heat away.

255
00:19:02,020 --> 00:19:03,060
‪Bingo.

256
00:19:03,150 --> 00:19:04,480
‪No. No. No!

257
00:19:07,900 --> 00:19:12,530
‪I'm just thankful to all retail workers
‪who wear appropriate seasonal wear, 

258
00:19:12,620 --> 00:19:14,210
‪and that includes Yamada.

259
00:19:14,290 --> 00:19:16,250
‪So you don't think she's cute.

260
00:19:16,330 --> 00:19:17,500
‪I never said…

261
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:30,920
‪I think she's the type of person
‪who looks good in short sleeves.

262
00:19:32,260 --> 00:19:34,350
‪That's quite a sweat
‪you're working up there.

263
00:19:34,430 --> 00:19:36,390
‪Well, it's hot today…

264
00:19:40,770 --> 00:19:43,980
‪Aren't you hot in that jacket?

265
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:45,980
‪I've got light layers on underneath.

266
00:19:46,070 --> 00:19:47,910
‪I've got nothing on you.

267
00:19:48,900 --> 00:19:49,900
‪Really?

268
00:19:49,990 --> 00:19:51,030
‪Yeah.

269
00:19:53,490 --> 00:19:54,490
‪See?

270
00:19:56,740 --> 00:19:58,830
‪Tayama! I'm sorry…

271
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:03,500
‪I'm sorry for looking at your stomach!

272
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:05,670
‪Doesn't…

273
00:20:09,470 --> 00:20:11,260
‪Doesn't your midriff get cold?

274
00:20:14,430 --> 00:20:17,520
‪Doesn't your midriff get cold?
‪Doesn't your midriff get cold?

275
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:20,560
‪No? No? No?

276
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:22,560
‪YAMADA'S SHORT SLEEVES

277
00:20:22,650 --> 00:20:24,190
‪Beautiful!

278
00:20:24,270 --> 00:20:25,360
‪TAYAMA'S MIDRIFF

279
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:26,440
‪Yay!

280
00:20:26,520 --> 00:20:28,400
‪Aren't you cold? Are you all right?

281
00:20:34,530 --> 00:20:37,160
‪Dang, this old geezer…

282
00:20:39,620 --> 00:20:40,620
‪Tayama.

283
00:20:41,290 --> 00:20:42,630
‪If you'd like…

284
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:45,960
‪There's still a cold breeze out at night.

285
00:20:51,260 --> 00:20:53,510
‪You don't have to wear it
‪if you don't want to--

286
00:20:54,050 --> 00:20:56,510
‪What? Tayama. I'm sorry.

287
00:20:56,600 --> 00:20:59,140
‪I thought you might want
‪to layer it over your stomach.

288
00:20:59,220 --> 00:21:01,810
‪I wasn't telling you to cover up!

289
00:21:01,890 --> 00:21:03,310
‪Did I offend…

290
00:21:04,310 --> 00:21:05,310
‪you?

291
00:21:09,070 --> 00:21:10,200
‪Tayama?

292
00:21:17,450 --> 00:21:19,490
‪Shut it, arms man.

293
00:21:20,410 --> 00:21:21,490
‪Arms man?

294
00:21:28,630 --> 00:21:29,670
‪I don't get it.

295
00:21:29,750 --> 00:21:31,710
‪Arms man? What's that?

296
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:48,560
‪I guess I really am dense
‪when it comes to these things.

297
00:21:58,490 --> 00:22:02,040
‪So you like arms
‪more than you do midriffs, Sasaki.

298
00:22:04,460 --> 00:22:06,300
‪SQUISH

299
00:22:06,870 --> 00:22:08,790
‪LEMON CHUHAI

300
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:11,920
‪Guess I'm laying off
‪the ramen for a while.

301
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:39,890
‪Subtitle translation by: Rychelle Brittain
